--- !u!114 &283509883
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 283509881}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Altarul T\u0103m\xE2ierii era un altar sacru folosit pentru arderea t\u0103m\xE2ii
    ca ofrand\u0103 zilnic\u0103 adus\u0103 lui Dumnezeu. Construit din lemn de salc\xE2m
    \u0219i acoperit cu aur, avea o form\u0103 p\u0103trat\u0103, m\u0103sur\xE2nd
    aproximativ 0,5 metri \xEEn lungime \u0219i l\u0103\u021Bime \u0219i 1 metru
    \xEEn \xEEn\u0103l\u021Bime. Era prev\u0103zut cu patru coarne la col\u021Buri
    \u0219i un chenar ornamental de aur \xEEn partea superioar\u0103. Situat \xEEn
    Sf\xE2nta, \xEEnaintea perdelei care separa Locul Preasf\xE2nt, altarul era folosit
    de preo\u021Bi pentru a arde t\u0103m\xE2ie \xEEn fiecare diminea\u021B\u0103
    \u0219i sear\u0103. Simboliza rug\u0103ciunile poporului care se \xEEn\u0103l\u021Bau
    c\u0103tre Dumnezeu \u0219i a fost distrus sau luat de babilonieni \xEEn anul
    586 \xEE.Hr., odat\u0103 cu distrugerea Ierusalimului."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
